WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Hi there! Meet DeepsFleet360 — one control tower for every vehicle and every route.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Register your company, add your vehicles and drivers, and choose the plan that fits your fleet.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Plan a trip with a fuel estimate, dispatch it, and follow each vehicle along the corridor.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Log fuel and maintenance, and let predictive alerts warn you before a breakdown happens.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Give clients a clear view of their own trips, fuel spend, and fleet — and export it all to CSV.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
DeepsFleet360 — built for PNG's toughest terrains by Deeps Systems. Everything here is demo data.
